<title>COLOMBIA: SOCCER-DEPORTIVO CALI BEAT PENAROL 2-0 IN LIBERTADORES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DEPORTIVO CALI BEAT PENAROL 2-0 IN LIBERTADORES.</headline>
<dateline>CALI, Colombia 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deportivo Cali</p>
<p>(Colombia) beat Penarol (Uruguay) 2-0 (halftime 0-0) in a South</p>
<p>American Libertadores Cup first round, group five match on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Escobar 46, Carlos Valderrama 59.</p>
<p>    Standings		 P  W  D  L  F  A  Pts</p>
<p> Penarol			3  2  0  1  6  4  6</p>
<p> Millonarios (Colombia)   3  2  0  1  5  4  6</p>
<p> Deportivo Cali	     2  1  0  1  3  3  3</p>
<p> Nacional (Uruguay)	 2  0  0  2  2  6  0</p>
<p>Note: top three qualify for the second round.</p>
</text>
